WEBVTT

00:02.640 --> 00:03.920
General Chen.

00:04.000 --> 00:09.160
You come with a Ministry of War order to take my, Prince of Jin's, military command.

00:09.240 --> 00:12.640
I'm afraid that's not enough authority how about.

00:12.720 --> 00:14.120
General Chen.

00:14.200 --> 00:19.000
Go get an imperial edict Your Highness is deliberately making this difficult.

00:20.120 --> 00:21.520
See the guest out.

00:38.320 --> 00:43.040
I said the second prince definitely has treacherous intentions look.

00:44.360 --> 00:48.080
Leaving him outside will cause trouble sooner or later.

00:48.520 --> 00:54.080
When Prince of Jin was imprisoned before I advised Your Highness to go all the way.

00:54.480 --> 01:00.400
But Your Highness then hesitated Chancellor Chen, don't tease me now.

01:00.480 --> 01:04.387
We must prevent the second prince from raising troops and marching on the capital.

01:08.600 --> 01:13.040
Order Qingzhou Army vanguard forced march abandon supplies.

01:13.120 --> 01:18.720
I don't care how many die from exhaustion at the fastest speed rush to all the passes must.

01:18.880 --> 01:20.520
Get there before Prince of Jin.

01:20.600 --> 01:21.720
Yes.

01:23.000 --> 01:38.000
Ten days later, Lu Xun led the Qingzhou Army to blockade all critical passes and strategic routes along the Tianhe River. By the time you thought of raising troops, it was already too late.

01:38.080 --> 01:45.000
Prince Ning's hidden ambushes erupted on all sides. Though your personal guard fought furiously to the death, escape proved impossible.

